---
// ServicesIntro.astro - Split editorial overview ("Get graphic design, print, motion, video and more")
---

<section class="sv-intro" id="services-overview" aria-labelledby="sv-intro-title">
  <div class="sv-intro__glow" aria-hidden="true"></div>

  <div class="container sv-intro__grid">
    <div class="sv-intro__copy" data-sv-reveal>
      <p class="adaptif-eyebrow" data-cms-key="services.intro.eyebrow">
        A variety of design services at your fingertips
      </p>

      <h2 id="sv-intro-title" class="sv-intro__title" data-cms-key="services.intro.title">
        Get graphic design, print, <span class="title-highlight">motion, video and more</span>
      </h2>

      <p class="sv-intro__lead" data-cms-key="services.intro.lead">
        Whether you need an out-of-this-world illustration, beautiful print designs, or engaging digital marketing assets, Adaptif’s world-class graphic designers from around the world will make it happen.
      </p>

      <p class="sv-intro__body" data-cms-key="services.intro.body">
        Unlike traditional graphic design agencies, Adaptif is a tech-enabled, Creative-as-a-Service design solution built to keep up with the evolving needs and fast pace of enterprise teams. Access a full suite of design services through a transparent design subscription model.
      </p>

      <div class="sv-intro__actions">
        <a
          href="#book-a-call"
          class="adaptif-btn"
          data-open-book-call
          data-cms-key="services.intro.cta"
        >
          <span>Book a Call</span>
          <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="none" aria-hidden="true">
            <path
              d="M4.16666 10H15.8333M15.8333 10L10 4.16666M15.8333 10L10 15.8333"
              stroke="currentColor"
              stroke-width="2"
              stroke-linecap="round"
              stroke-linejoin="round"
            />
          </svg>
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="sv-intro__visual" data-sv-reveal="scale" style="--sv-delay: 120ms">
      <div class="sv-intro__frame">
        <img
          src="/images/services/intro-workspace.jpg"
          alt="Creative designer working across multi-screen digital and cosmic brand interfaces"
          class="sv-intro__img"
          loading="lazy"
          decoding="async"
          data-cms-key="services.intro.image"
        />
        <div class="sv-intro__frame-vignette" aria-hidden="true"></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .sv-intro {
    position: relative;
    padding: clamp(72px, 9vw, 120px) 0;
    background: var(--color-void);
    overflow: hidden;
  }

  .sv-intro__glow {
    position: absolute;
    top: 10%;
    right: 6%;
    width: 520px;
    height: 520px;
    background: radial-gradient(circle, rgba(72, 200, 255, 0.1) 0%, transparent 70%);
    pointer-events: none;
  }

  .sv-intro__grid {
    position: relative;
    z-index: 1;
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1.02fr) minmax(0, 0.98fr);
    gap: clamp(36px, 5vw, 72px);
    align-items: center;
  }

  .sv-intro__title {
    margin: 14px 0 22px;
    font-family: var(--font-family-display);
    font-size: clamp(2.25rem, 4vw, 3.35rem);
    font-weight: 400;
    line-height: 1.08;
    letter-spacing: -0.02em;
    color: var(--color-text-primary);
  }

  .sv-intro__lead {
    margin: 0 0 18px;
    font-family: var(--font-family-body);
    font-size: clamp(1.05rem, 1.3vw, 1.18rem);
    font-weight: 500;
    line-height: 1.55;
    color: var(--color-text-primary);
  }

  .sv-intro__body {
    margin: 0 0 32px;
    font-family: var(--font-family-body);
    font-size: 0.98rem;
    line-height: 1.68;
    color: var(--color-text-secondary);
  }

  .sv-intro__actions {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 16px;
  }

  .sv-intro__frame {
    position: relative;
    border-radius: 20px;
    overflow: hidden;
    border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);
    box-shadow:
      0 28px 64px -20px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.78),
      0 0 40px -14px rgba(72, 200, 255, 0.18);
    aspect-ratio: 1 / 1;
  }

  .sv-intro__img {
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    object-fit: cover;
    display: block;
  }

  .sv-intro__frame-vignette {
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0;
    background: linear-gradient(180deg, transparent 60%, rgba(1, 3, 7, 0.45) 100%);
    pointer-events: none;
  }

  @media (max-width: 960px) {
    .sv-intro__grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: 36px;
    }

    .sv-intro__frame {
      max-width: 540px;
      margin: 0 auto;
    }
  }
</style>
